      skos:altLabel "Artificial Intelligence"@en ;
      skos:definition "A computing knowledge area concerned with intelligent systems, artificial intelligence methods, and computational techniques for reasoning, learning, and autonomous behavior."@en ;
      skos:inScheme cc2020:SystemsArchitectureAndInfrastructure ;
